y facility near the monitor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 23 de octubre de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en Nederland 17th Street registró 10.78 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 7:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.02 ppb. El viento venía de 87 grados a 1.6 mph. El viento era demasiado débil para saber de dónde venía el aire, así que no se traza un corredor. No se encontró un reporte que coincida en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación cercana al monitor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["New region: no backtest yet; statuses use the same rules; no claims are made from it.","A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used, never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"region_beaumont/agc_2024_48_245_0009_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_245_0009","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88096,"sha256":"fcf11e1cd673712b8530edf31e01f0895f105c09b24eabfbc6c129e5ea58ffee","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T03:40:29+00:00"},{"file":"region_beaumont/agc_2024_48_245_1035_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","param